o tax under the new regime ."}], "reference_indexes": [1]}, {"type": "paragraph", "snippet": "You can check your detailed calculation through the Income Tax Department Portal or reference guides like Bajaj Finserv Standard Deduction Guide .", "snippet_links": [{"text": "Income Tax Department Portal", "link": "https://www.incometax.gov.in/iec/foportal/help/individual/return-applicable-1"}, {"text": "Bajaj Finserv Standard Deduction Guide", "link": "https://www.bajajfinserv.in/about-standard-deduction"}], "reference_indexes": [0, 4]}, {"type": "paragraph", "snippet": "If you'd like, share your gross annual salary and I can help calculate your approximate net taxable income and tax liability under the new regime."}], "references": [{"index": 0, "title": "Standard Deduction on Salary for FY 2024-25 (AY 2025-26)", "link": "https://www.bajajfinserv.in/about-standard-deduction", "snippet": "* Maximise your earnings with returns up to 7.30% p.a. for Senior Citizens and up to 6.95% p.a. for citizens below 60 years of age. Open FD. * Personal Loan. Get f...", "source": "Bajaj Finserv", "source_icon": "https://encrypted-tbn3.gstatic.com/faviconV2?url=https://www.bajajfinserv.in&client=AIM&size=128&type=FAVICON&fallback_opts=TYPE,SIZE,URL", "thumbnail": "https://encrypted-tbn2.gstatic.com/images?q=tbn:ANd9GcSA98ly6x_sBebeJ_a2NE-nwZ75IXSwzvwSGuVER3OkoUpRTDyXHWGGNpdS45OvWP9Iw_PKP2D9oQmhD5p73zXiOP6vmO6EgkW7W7LM"}, {"index": 1, "title": "New Tax Regime India 2026", "link": "https://takehomecalc.in/blog/what-is-new-tax-regime", "snippet": "default regime * The ₹12 Lakh Zero-Tax Benefit Under Section 87A, if your taxable income (after standard deduction) does not exceed ₹12,00,000, you get a full tax ...", "source": "takehomecalc.in", "source_icon": "https://encrypted-tbn3.gstatic.com/faviconV2?url=https://takehomecalc.in&client=AIM&size=128&type=FAVICON&fallback_opts=TYPE,SIZE,URL", "thumbnail": "https://encrypted-tbn1.gstatic.com/images?q=tbn:ANd9GcQX9JZZ286xfkD_BOVmcrQlX7lsOARwbcS